=== THU NGHIEM BUOC 4: GIOI HAN NEN TANG CUA BOUNDED MODEL CHECKING (BMC) ===

1. MO TA THI NGHIEM:
   - Chuong trinh muc tieu: BMC-01-SAFE-FULL-SCAN
   - Kich thuoc mang (array_size): 10
   - Vong lap thuc te trong C: for (int i = 0; i < 10; i++) catalog[i]
   - Thay doi thuc nghiem: Ha unwind_bound tu 10 xuong 5 (nho hon array_size=10)

2. KET QUA CHAY BMC VOI UNWIND_BOUND = 5:
   - Ket qua BMC tra ve: SAFE up to bound 5 (Khong tim thay vi pham trong 5 buoc unwind dau tien)
   - Z3 chi kiem tra cac buoc i = 0, 1, 2, 3, 4.
   - Tai ca 5 buoc nay, index = 0, 1, 2, 3, 4 deu thuoc [0, 10) -> UNSAT tren Not(assertion).

3. GIAI THICH BAN CHAT KHOA HOC VA GIOI HAN NEN TANG:
   (a) Tai sao BMC van bao SAFE?
       Vi trong pham vi 5 buoc duoc yeu cau kiem tra (i=0..4), khong co bat ky chi so nao vuot ngoai bien [0, 10).
       BMC hoan toan 'trung thuc' voi gioi han k ma nguoi dung chi dinh.

   (b) Tai sao 'SAFE up to bound k' KHONG DU DE KET LUAN AN TOAN TUYET DOI?
       - Neu mot chuong trinh C co loi o buoc i = 8 (vi du: tai buoc thu 8 bien so bi tran hoac truy cap loi),
         nhung chung ta chi thiet lap unwind_bound k = 5, BMC se hoan toan bo sot loi do va bao 'SAFE'.
       - Day la su khac biet song con giua:
         + 'SAFE up to bound k' (An toan cuc bo trong k buoc lap)
         + 'Unbounded Safety' (An toan tuyet doi cho moi so lan lap)
       - BMC khong the tu chung minh tinh bat bien (loop invariant) hoac su ket thuc an toan cua vong lap
         neu khong co 'completeness threshold' (nguong hoan tat) hoac khong ket hop voi k-induction.
       - Do do, khi su dung cong cu BMC (nhu CBMC hay Z3 BMC), nguoi kiem chung phai luon biet ro so buoc
         unwind toi thieu can thiet de bao quat toan bo hanh vi cua chuong trinh.
